<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Meurig ap Tewdrig</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">6th or 7th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/7th-century">7th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Meurig ap Tewdrig was a king of Glywysing and Gwent in south-east <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wales">Wales</a>, probably in the 6th or 7th century. The charters of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/book-of-llandaff">Book of Llandaff</a> record his grants to the church, and his descendants ruled both kingdoms for generations.</p></div>
